# Semgrep ignore rules for Finman
#
# The html.security.audit.missing-integrity rule fires on <link rel="canonical">
# tags because their href is an absolute https:// URL. Canonical tags are
# metadata hints — they are never fetched as scripts/stylesheets — so SRI does
# not apply. All actual CSS/JS assets in public/marketing/ are self-hosted
# same-origin resources; SRI on same-origin links provides no security benefit.
public/marketing/
